  <LocalizedText>
	<Text id="LOC_MOD_FLAC_MENTALAI_NAME">
		<en_US>Mental AI Boost</en_US>
		<zh_Hans_CN>终结级AI强化</zh_Hans_CN>
	</Text>
	<Text id="LOC_MOD_FLAC_MENTALAI_TEASER">
		<en_US>AI will be greatly buff in all aspects (the degree of enhancement is proportional to the number of cities).</en_US>
		<zh_Hans_CN>AI将会从各方面得到巨大的强化（强化程度与城市数量成正比）。</zh_Hans_CN>
	</Text>
	<Text id="LOC_MOD_FLAC_MENTALAI_DESCRIPTION">
		<en_US>AI will be greatly buff in all aspects (the degree of enhancement is proportional to the number of cities).</en_US>
		<zh_Hans_CN>AI将会从各方面得到巨大的强化（强化程度与城市数量成正比）。</zh_Hans_CN>
	</Text>
  </LocalizedText>
